# Durable platform truth store (JSON-per-object). Contents are gitignored;
# this file keeps the directory in version control.
#
# BACKUP IS NOT `cp -r ./data` (that is what this line used to say, and it was
# wrong in two ways: on the deployed host the runtime files belong to the
# container's uid, so a plain host-side copy gets Permission denied; and a copy
# that stays on the same disk is not a backup at all — GH#123).
#
#   scheduled, off-machine   tools/deploy/ggd-backup.sh   (docs/runbooks/offsite-backup.md)
#   one-off, by hand         make family-archive-export   (#243, docs/runbooks/platform-migration.md)
